160			\item 
161			
162			\label{assumption:small-pictures-w-appendix}
163			there is a canonical form $\can$ such that every equation of the form  $\can(e)e\1 = 1$ for $e\in E$ is witnessed by a $\G$-picture in which each generator and relation appears at most $m_0$ times,
164			\item 
165			\label{assumption:small-pictures-appendix}
166			 every equation of the form $\can(g)\can(gh)\1\can(h) = 1$ $g,h\in \G$ is witnessed by a $\G$-picture 
167			 proving in which 
168			 each generator and 
169			 each relation is used at most $m$ times,
