144	\begin{definition}[Operator solution]
145		An \emph{operator solution} for the game $\LCS(\mathbf H, l, \Z_d)$ is a unitary representation $\s$ of the group $\G(\mathbf H, l, \Z_d)$ such that $\s(J) = \w_dI$. A \emph{conjugate operator solution} is a unitary representation sending $J\mapsto \bar{\w_d}I$.

